<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00356/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：一支██牌的铅笔，使用时会怀疑笔中没有墨水<br /></strong>回收日期：<strong>20██/██/██<br /></strong>回收地点：湖北省██市的一家超市<br />
<strong>当前状态：放置于Site-CN-██低价值异常物品保存库<br /></strong>笔记：这玩意儿好像没墨了——研究员██<br />
可是这是支铅笔啊——D.r███</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00356" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00356" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00356-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lele-pi" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6290056); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6290056&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608212916" alt="LeLe Pi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6290056)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lele-pi" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6290056); return false;">LeLe Pi</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1597282944 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">13 Aug 2020 01:42</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00441/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一只█技牌无线鼠标，当持有者将其放入书包尝试前往图书馆时，该鼠标有8█%的概率会瞬间移动至持有者寝室的桌面上并使持有者产生“我又忘了带鼠标”的错觉。该批次产品均有异常现象。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>研究员ENC的寝室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被研究员ENC在寝室使用<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>当我连续███次去图书馆发现没带鼠标，我就知道这玩意不对劲了——研究员ENC</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00441" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00441" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00441-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6273721&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608212916" alt="EdwardNewtChen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6273721)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;">EdwardNewtChen</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1602464155 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">12 Oct 2020 00:55</span></p>
